"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nI went early and fortunately was able to eat right away without waiting.  \nThe interior might look a bit unhygienic and hot, which could be off-putting, but since it's a famous spot, I went in without hesitation.  \n\nThe broth might seem light at first, but it's rich with a deep prawn flavor.  \nI really enjoyed it.  \n\nYou have to pay in cash, and I recommend ordering a juice from the separate stall next to the ordering counter.  \n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n"